        "text_wQBhyP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<h5><strong>1.Shipping Rates</strong><br/>- Scale-O offers flat-rate shipping within India for all orders.<br/>- Shipping rates may vary depending on the destination and order size.<br/>- Express shipping options may be available at an additional cost.<br/><br/><strong>2.Order Processing</strong><br/>- Orders are typically processed and shipped within 5 business days of the order placement.<br/>- Order processing times may vary during peak seasons, festivals or due to unforeseen circumstances. Any delays will be communicated to customers promptly.<br/><br/><strong>3.Delivery Times</strong><br/>- Estimated delivery times vary depending on the shipping destination and selected shipping method but our products are usually shipped in 7 days for orders in India and 14 days for orders abroad.<br/>- Customers will receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information once their order has been dispatched.<br/>- Delivery times are estimates and not guaranteed. Actual delivery times may vary due to factors such as inclement weather conditions or carrier delays by the logistic services. <br/><br/><strong>4.Shipping Restrictions</strong><br/>- Scale-O currently ships within India. For international shipping inquiries, please contact our customer service team.<br/>- Certain products may be subject to shipping restrictions or regulations based on the destination. Customers are responsible for ensuring compliance with local laws and regulations regarding product importation.<br/><br/><strong>5.Order Tracking</strong><br/>- Customers can track the status of their order using the provided tracking information.<br/>- If you encounter any issues with tracking your order or have questions about its status, please contact our customer service team for assistance.<br/><br/><strong>6.Shipping Address</strong><br/>- Customers are responsible for providing accurate and complete shipping addresses with landmark and pin code details at the time of order placement.<br/>- Scale-O is not liable for any delays or delivery issues resulting from incorrect or incomplete shipping information provided by the customer.<br/><br/><strong>7.Shipping Carriers</strong><br/>- Scale-O partners with reputable shipping carriers to ensure reliable and timely delivery of orders.<br/>- The shipping carrier used for each order may vary depending on factors such as the destination and shipping method selected.<br/><br/><strong>8.Contact Us</strong><br/>If you have any questions or concerns about our shipping policy, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team:<br/>Email: support@scale-o.com<br/>Phone: 9909963300<br/><br/>Thank you for choosing Scale-O. We appreciate your business and strive to provide the best possible shipping experience for our customers.<br/><br/>At Scale-O, we strive to provide our customers with the highest quality products and an exceptional shopping experience. If, for any reason, you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, we offer a straightforward refund, return, and exchange policy to ensure your satisfaction.</h5>",
